  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In the growling beast painting world, Fairy Bi Xia praises craftsman Gu for weak battle strength but broad usage while Zhao Shu Ye commands about a hundred craftsmen building a camp. Zhao Shu Ye says its prospects beat thief Gu, soldier Gu, and officer Gu, and that besides processing immortal materials and constructing Gu houses it can also refine Gu. He used labor union token Gu to build a labor union, carries union head Gu, and gave supervisor Gu to about twelve high ranked craftsman Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          2081
